530/extras/338280371d4a1bb59173dda9ea0ffd47.webm?t=1634603683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1525530/extras/338280371d4a1bb59173dda9ea0ffd47.mp4?t=1634603683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Save the 'Verse from THE CORRUPTION, a program gone rouge. It's only purpose is now the complete and total deletion of the 'Verse and all backup data. You'll discover the origin of the 'Verse, how the CORRUPTION came to be, and why it's hellbent on the complete and total destruction of not only itself but all of the 'Verse.<br> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1525530/extras/c176adf434f693e027df8969a86bdb02.poster.avif?t=1634603683\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1525530/extras/c176adf434f693e027df8969a86bdb02.webm?t=1634603683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1525530/extras/c176adf434f693e027df8969a86bdb02.mp4?t=1634603683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
